  <!-- Generated once from the original sources named in mac/plans/chrome-guidelines.md section 2 and then maintained by hand;
       ThemeTokenTests re-reads those sources and compares every value. Each token is a Color (Cr.Name) and a SolidColorBrush (Cr.NameBrush).
       Format is #AARRGGBB. Dark theme. -->

